  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E ndalogo jo-Filistia nochoko jolwenjgi mondo oked gi Israel. Akish nowacho ni Daudi niya, \"Nyaka ingʼe ni in gi jogi udhi koda e lweny.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi nowachone niya, \"To koro inine gi wangʼi gima jatiji nyalo timo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akish nodwoke niya, \"Mano ber, abiro keti jaritna e ndalo duto mar ngimana.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo gi ajwoga madhako modak Endor",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuel nosetho kendo Israel duto noywage mine giike e dalane man Rama. Saulo noseriembo ajuoke, gi jo-nyakalondo oa e piny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo-Filistia nochokore mobiro mojot e Shunem, ka Saulo bende nochoko jo-Israel duto modhi ojot Gilboa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Saulo noneno jolwenj jo-Filistia luoro gi kihondko nomake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nopenjo Jehova Nyasaye wach, to Jehova Nyasaye ne ok odwoke e yor lek kata gi Urim kata gi dho jonabi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka Saulo nowachone joma tiyone niya, \"Dwarnauru dhako ma ja-nyakalondo, mondo adhi apenje wach.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Negidwoke niya, \"Nitie moro Endor.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi Saulo notemo loko nenruokne korwako lewni mopogore opogore, eka en gi ji ariyo moko negidhi ir dhako ma ja-nyakalondo gotieno. Nowacho niya, \"Penjna wach kuom chuny ngʼat motho kendo ikelna ngʼatno mabiro nyisi nyinge.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka dhakono nowachone niya, \"Chutho ingʼeyo gima Saulo nosetimo. Osetieko jo-nyakalondo gi ajuoke e piny. Angʼo momiyo ichiko obadho ne ngimana, mondo okelna tho?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo nokwongʼore gi nying Jehova Nyasaye niya, \"Akwongʼora gi nying Jehova Nyasaye mangima ni ok nokumi kuom timo ma.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eka dhakoni nopenje niya, \"En ngʼa ma idwaro mondo agolni?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nowachne niya, \"Golna Samuel.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kane dhakono oneno Samuel noywak gi dwol maduongʼ mowachone Saulo niya, \"Angʼo momiyo isewuonda? In Saulo!\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruoth nowachone niya, \"Kik ibed maluor. Angʼo ma ineno?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "To dhakono nowachone niya, \"Aneno chuny ngʼama nosetho kawuok e lowo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To nopenje niya, \"Ochalo nadi?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nowachone niya, \"Jaduongʼ moti morwako law abola ema wuok.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eka Saulo nongʼeyo ni en Samuel, mi nokulore nyaka e lowo monindo piny e lowo auma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuel nowachone Saulo niya, \"Angʼo momiyo ichanda kimiyo awuok oko?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo nodwoke niya, \"An gi midhiero maduongʼ. Jo-Filistia osemonja kendo kedo koda, Nyasaye bende oseweya. Tinde ok odwoka, gi dwond jonabi kata e yor lek. Mano emomiyo aluongi ni mondo iwachna gima onego atim?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuel nowacho niya, \"Angʼo momiyo ipenja wach ka Jehova Nyasaye oseweyi mobedo jasiki?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye osetimo mana gima nakoroni. Jehova Nyasaye osegolo loch e lweti mi omiye achiel kuom jobathi ma en Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikech nidagi winjo Jehova Nyasaye kendo timo kaka nochiki mondo itim ne jo-Amalek mane en-go gi mirima maduongʼ, mano emomiyo Jehova Nyasaye osetimoni gini kawuono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehova Nyasaye dhi chiwo jo-Israel kaachiel kodi ni jo-Filistia, kendo kiny in kod yawuoti unubed koda. Jehova Nyasaye biro chiwo jolweny mag Israel ni jo-Filistia.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To gisano Saulo nogore moriere piny ka luoro omake nikech weche Samuel. Tekre norumo nikech ne pok ochiemo odiechiengʼ ngima gi otieno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kane dhakono obiro ir Saulo moneno kaka nobwok malich, nowacho niya, \"Ne, jatichni madhako osetimo gima ne ichike. Ne akawo ngimana ka nono kane atimo gima ne iwacho ni atim.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koro yie iwinj jatichni mondo iyiena amiyi chiemo moro minyalo chamo mondo iyud teko mar dok.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nodagi mowacho niya, \"Ok nachiem.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "1SA 28:23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "To joge noriwore gi dhakono kamedo kwaye, mi nowinjogi. Noa malo e lowo mobet e kom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dhakono ne nigi nyarwath machwe e ode, mine oyangʼe mapiyo piyo. Nokawo mogo, modwalo motedogo makati ma ok oketie thowi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
